ds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dye, Petalfall Ingredient</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Tamed Mysterious Mushroom</b> is a flower that can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Mushroom Cave</a>, near the <a href=\"/wiki/Oobmab\" title=\"Oobmab\">Oobmab</a> Lake. It is located in the same place where the <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> is crafted. It is used as a dye and as an ingredient for crafting the <a href=\"/wiki/Petalfall\" title=\"Petalfall\">Petalfall</a> Katana.\n</p><p>It can be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\">Jer Junkman</a> for $150, or in its dye form for $600.\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, its fill level increases by ~28.57%\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163648\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019515/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.786      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   29.786      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2706-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163648 and revision id 18744. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Uncertainty Cave","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Fusion Coil","exists":true},{"title":"Jer Junkman","exists":true},{"title":"Oobmab","exists":true},{"title":"Petalfall","exists":true}],"images":["Tamed_Mysterious_Mushroom.png"]}
